### Get all properties
GET http://localhost:8080/properties

###

### Create a new property
POST http://localhost:8080/properties
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "address": "123 Maple Street, Tagaytay",
    "price": 4500000,
    "bedrooms": 3,
    "bathrooms": 2,
    "squareFeet": 1200,
    "status": "Available",
    "description": "Cozy 3-bedroom home near the city center with a view of the ridge.",
    "listingDate": "2026-09-22"
}

